<!-- Answer -->
To modify the default prompts in the "Chat Casual" column on the homepage so that everyone can directly chat with the default prompts assistant without additional operations when accessing, you need to update the `locales/zh-CN/chat.json` file The `inbox.desc` field.

Here is the relevant JSON snippet:

```json
{
  "inbox": {
    "desc": "Turn on the brain cluster and stimulate the spark of thinking. Your intelligent assistant is here to communicate with you about everything",
    "title": "Just chat"
  }
}
```

Additionally, you can update the default message your assistant sends when a user starts a conversation. This can be achieved by modifying the `agentDefaultMessage` field in the same JSON file:

```json
{
  "agentDefaultMessage": "Hello, I'm **{{name}}**. You can start a conversation with me now!",
  "inbox": {
    "desc": "Turn on the brain cluster and stimulate the spark of thinking. Your intelligent assistant is here to communicate with you about everything",
    "title": "Just chat"
  }
}
```

After this modification, users will see prompt information when accessing the "Chat Casually" column, and can directly talk to the default prompts assistant <sup>[[1]](https://github.com/lobehub/lobe -chat/blob/main/locales/en-US/chat.json)</sup><sup>[[2]](https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-chat/blob/main/locales/ de-DE/chat.json)</sup>.


